  "prefLabel": "Pda 101.04 Barker wharf",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pda 101.04 “Barker wharf” means the fixed piers, wharves, docks, and attached floats on or attached to division property in Portsmouth Harbor located on parcel A-1, as identified on the inventory of division property maintained pursuant to RSA 12-G:43 I(e).\n\nSource. #7847, eff 3-8-03; ss by #8760, eff 11-18-06",
